---
<section class="bg-dark-background py-20" data-ps="armed-money-escorts/ArmedMoneyEscortsHero.astro">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
      <span class="status-dot">[ Dispatch Status: Active — 24/7/365 ]</span>
    </div>
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div>
        <h1
          class="font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-dark-foreground mb-6"
          style="font-size: var(--text-h1); line-height: 1.05;"
        >
          Armed Money Escorts
        </h1>
        <p class="text-dark-muted-foreground text-base leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-lg">
          Through vigilance and attention to detail, KRE Security has performed countless escorts without incident over the course of our last 35 years in business. Protection and safety of our customers is our top priority.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-block bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm px-8 py-4 border-2 border-primary hover:bg-primary-hover transition-colors duration-150"
          >
            Request a Quote
          </a>
          <a
            href="tel:16105620971"
            class="inline-block bg-transparent text-dark-foreground font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm px-8 py-4 border-2 border-dark-border hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-150"
          >
            610-562-0971
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="tactical-frame overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/d22f750a/images/Screenshot-2023-11-09-at-1_25_26-PM-320.webp"
            alt="Armed money escort services"
            class="w-full h-40 object-cover"
            loading="eager"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="tactical-frame overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/d22f750a/images/ATM-keypad-320.webp"
            alt="ATM services"
            class="w-full h-40 object-cover"
            loading="eager"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
